Reflex-2
Copyright 2026 suzuki_shoten

Reflex-2 uses Google EmbeddingGemma 2 (https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-2),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0, as its base model. The base model's weights are not modified.
Reflex-2 is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google.

The fall-detection head (heads/fall.json) was trained by suzuki_shoten on GMDCSA24
(https://github.com/ekramalam/GMDCSA24-A-Dataset-for-Human-Fall-Detection-in-Videos),
licensed under the MIT License. The demo videos in media/ use clips from GMDCSA24.

The surveillance comparison image in media/ uses two frames from UCF-Crime
(Sultani, Chen and Shah, CVPR 2018), shown for research comparison; the face is pixelated.

The sound demo (media/audio_en.mp4, media/audio_en.gif, media/ja/audio_ja.gif) contains clips from ESC-50
(Piczak, ACM Multimedia 2015, https://github.com/karolpiczak/ESC-50), licensed under CC BY-NC 3.0.
These media files are shared for non-commercial demonstration under that license; they are not covered by
the Apache License 2.0 of the code.
